The youngest, and the angriest."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["The Demon Lord had burned my city when I was nine. I"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["wanted every demon in the world dead, and everything that"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["had touched one, and everything that might, later."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["So I purged. Villages the miasma had brushed. Wells. Once"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["a whole valley, because two of the dead there had been"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["seen to twitch. The Death arts, you've seen them. I was"]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["very good at them."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Falin",0,0,2,"Falin"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["…And Akira?"]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Akira took my command away at Frostheim, the last winter"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["of the war. In front of the Host. I was dying by then,"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["a spear through me, and I was so angry I couldn't see."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Something came to me, lying there in the snow. A merchant"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["in brass, with a contract for anger. Keep fighting, he"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["said. Forever. Purge everything. Only sign."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Kanta",0,0,2,"Kanta"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Gōen."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Akira tore the contract out of my hands. She refused it"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["for me. So I died, angry, unbought, and I stayed angry"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["for seven hundred years, in the dark, until a thread"]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["pulled tight and there was a girl with a light in her"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["hand, waking up in a cave."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["\"The General who was refused.\" That's what he calls me."]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["He's right. It's the best thing anyone ever did for me."]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Actor3",2,0,2,"Tsukishiro Yukino"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["…"]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Kanta",0,0,2,"Kanta"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["Are you still angry?"]},{"code":101,"indent":3,"parameters":["Hanma",0,0,2,"Hanma"]},{"code":401,"indent":3,"parameters":["…Less, my Lord. Less every day. Don't tell anyone."]},{"code":121,"indent":3,"parameters":[140,140,0]},{"code":0,"indent":3,"parameters":[]},{"code":412,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":411,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":2,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["Twenty silver. You don't have it."]},{"code":0,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":412,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"No"]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":404,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":false}],"x":8,"y":26},
